  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You have gained a small measure of control over the curse. You gain 1 Control Point, which you can spend to transform into your Animal Form as an Action using the activity on this feature. You regain all expended Control Points when you finish a Long Rest. Your Control Point maximum increases as you gain Stages (@scale.therianthrope.control-points).</p>\n<p>A Controlled Transformation lasts a number of hours equal to half your Stage (rounded down). It ends early if you are reduced to 0 hit points or if you dismiss it as a Bonus Action. When the duration would expire, you can spend 1 additional Control Point to extend it by the same duration. Reverting from any transformation inflicts 1 level of Exhaustion; while transformed you ignore all Exhaustion.</p>",
